{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1455145-offspring-and-weird-covers","id":1455145,"title":"Offspring and weird covers","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-07-18T17:17:58-07:00","id":1455145,"title":"Offspring and weird covers","content":"Soooo I was just thinking about covers and giving birth/having kids. So if you go loud or your cover is reduced to 0 the unborn child bonds to one of the other covers you have. So let's say you have a cover that is...something not human. Your second cover is that of a cat, or a spirit, or something similarly weird. And unfortunately, you don't have any other covers that could serve the purpose for the pregnancy so you carry the unborn child to term as a spirit or a cat or whatever....What would be born?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8100-caedus","name":"Caedus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"300"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-07T03:26:44-07:00","id":1456291,"title":"","content":"Rule of thumb would be that Covers inherently tries to make sense, so I'd say they'd be born as what's the most logical for said Cover.<br /> <br /> However, it'd be probable that there would be some strange things with said offspring. Perhaps the cat is too damn intelligent, thinking more like a human than an animal for instance, or the spirit as strange bans and banes, etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1233-ur-than","name":"Ur-Than","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avat